{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1424,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8a0ba94c9bf3bdf3485815e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为班长的工作，中午经常会来迟\r\n但是！能被大家依赖到这种程度我很荣幸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1872c38a91ab7998e571abe94c7c9f3ff1a9b9dcb0b66a6b559aae4c21ff9c73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b7a16a391d776a33cc03664",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈调香的精油，\r\n放在枕头旁边就能安然入睡！\r\n我自己调香的就有点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "78e493ee380ba6c92cb819299c7ee09f0c4b0eae5e8429c8307a3bf9c0392a6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd65fa97beeaf15a7a184d18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈～…啊，对不起！\r\n因为起得很早，\r\n一到晚上马上就困了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e90d5b59c37d7db0dca43cf83e21ac8ebb946734e8a4f3235ed97a9989c178cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:565518816f5394b16bcf2179",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天天气容易变得不好。\r\n为了不耽误训练\r\n要不要做个晴天娃娃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a6fe793943d4703fa4357f7125f2426fc85e3c21126b6aa986270155dc2426a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e07c356bcf8b1575f5a10bf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在酷暑时节流了很多汗，\r\n很有成长了的感觉！\r\n满足感一下子就涌上来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46e3d6e18f84ab57df9228538c651317c9186ba503c351d9b68f0b07aff48808",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e005bbc6b3094bff1cf411a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正值运动之秋！所以\r\n周末我要和小奇宝她们\r\n一起去室内足球场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2096ed1f1110ea8ad82a334f0ee0922ecb5bbc41aec3ba101ea5a59ce9eb0a60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b26e69da240d081b7e9cbc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天从被窝里钻出来都很辛苦了，\r\n但是…打开窗户呼吸新鲜空气的瞬间，\r\n我一点也不讨厌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08b81bd57137897b63853bfd4a2e05e7173dfc62f61b4a06a51f4dd320524324",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e62e6d87c57fb8d2da92aa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88bb89362e30d3f2eeb76274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小宝穴早上好像很难起床……\r\n每天晨训以后去叫醒她，\r\n已经变成日常了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a4017ba9f31042d9b6711f8f17f873d493421014992641417db738a7ef63206",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0273f7e9324409aaaf117e51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…不注意的话\r\n就容易擦出小伤口…\r\n得保持冷静才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c54ded443295746278e123bf82e746dc10228b228e72a562d0109be7459d19c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48356870331b283f4b3dd011",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才跑步的时候\r\n被乌鸦包围了…好一阵子\r\n身体僵硬地动都动不了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "029fc49c8784b00099fb034f77436725a00f4b5c5584657d5cdf1c0149520221",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f471738affd8a1eb75bd6b2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果被纸割伤了手指的话，\r\n爱织同学会给我创可贴！\r\n还是小羊图案的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c9d8a3f131d00325715da07bc2df3f9cf8cd72de49a28d87ad5ceb27512895f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1518309debe46c7b06272a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有时候我会被叫去当小歌剧的翻译，\r\n说实话我倒觉得没有那么难理解…",
      "source_fingerprint": "988c3a8168d7f9a4f55657f010af5a668e1dee596606350f462f0a8497bd6740",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24255ce905504c01e639662",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在live的舞台上移动\r\n有时候需要转一个大圈…\r\n得格外小心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3e6f052a340c31487db6860c515830a61c63cadf3ee1e3a914fa8e0034373e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3834838ef2cf92ea05cd6b10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在舞台上听到大家的欢呼声、\r\n想要回应这个应援\r\n变得更有干劲了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a230182266d1387f33bfdf867a4270446bd4bfbc50db56b193ce353a7db49ab7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbe29c3e068eb2e93ddbb8ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紧张时会不由自主地抓住衣服下摆\r\n…不能穿着皱皱巴巴的衣服站在舞台上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b780752a960abeb69c01a8aa850648be7ea1631d8edcb727345df445eaacc56d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9ee2ee030cf20832e25c408",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这身决胜服就意味着\r\n要背负起大家的期待！\r\n我，绝对会赢的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea6fce85fd9cecb2b8d0a9c1cf4f18cc4f876780b7fb8f0e6c202490e6cd9d59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60357d2e104fccceba730e60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上要稍微早点到校！\r\n收笔记，还有打开教室窗户通风\r\n作为班长可是有很多工作的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ec6e9a84c7986dd814627c125fbfde13742362755915b922284e126b6f485c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81ad05429abcb3ad37f0aa0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自助餐厅的胡萝卜色拉\r\n我最喜欢了！\r\n不知不觉每天都会点～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "699d93ac31951248c71f50a5f9c30cc7d9b7dfb3bfa5bfbd68cc01b87f82433b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17f5d4de53bd2e0788a77e47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上有时候有机会\r\n会跟爱织同学一起跑步…\r\n那时候的星空真美呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f36fdf9e367420b2527b47fcf863d9de601a12cbd8a737f57444e57ead9955bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91bdf8b210f20609fb028915",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，新生们崭新的制服真好啊！\r\n有关宿舍生活的咨询什么的希望能帮上她们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04689664621b2f4b641918188d357aa64a5a2b089f239d4456aa7f1dabe75564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30487112cc9216adc2e4eec4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种浑身冒汗的感觉我很喜欢！\r\n这才有夏天的实感！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a933f52147338d27145f416861b057137b8db6fd6e67b430c3e6a388b348789",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5798a1bca85572d2c97f2cd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到秋天就不得不提运动了！\r\n我爸爸开的体育用品店里面，\r\n有一个我推荐商品的展示柜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f9eb904b371307bb3498766a985aabb30c6717e0ca99cc0906f146987be0856",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1e2fdcd8ab3893d8f1e6ebc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在冬天早晨晨练，\r\n身体慢慢变暖的瞬间很舒服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ccb102a6aba859d82b3760f29a5a6ebae07aea92bcc99f54bcd5f0a34e04f27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ca30f8d02c574b4cf67dbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "流下的汗水是不会骗人的！\r\n所以今天也要全力训练，\r\n请多关照！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f8dfe2be6c091a856d756dd011b5353d7f3cb68fd1a52adce0d80679cb1e4a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e7b67eb02d96b26f2cf3904",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張ります！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce668c40f253d10781168301572643428e336fa5787539b1a44cdadbef25cec7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:615c7fe3fca21b4ed748689f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我相信这样的积累一定会带来胜利！\r\n一定能跑出不辜负期待的样子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20d6352f9702daafaa4adb15137742bf264d620699ca80c074f5b617d73e0281",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14048d34e48c0137dc441020",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对不起，我赶上了吗！？\r\n因为班上有事，\r\n稍微来晚了一些！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b255110e1b91c802dffd87f45dcc9a341b307343e14ba4bf404edbdd789c6bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6d33a462473958ca0c39718",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用多虑，\r\n请多多安排锻炼内容！\r\n毕竟这也是为了成长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8743001813deffc63c71df03ea564f133b7910ef3e7bd424e83177d6ed06f4f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4ee4b47da50df835c45789e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备运动已经结束了！\r\n可以一起训练吗？\r\n我等不及了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a234ea9074f980d5d93dfd65175295048a03d8540a7cb1a24989b7cb77a9ec4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33f181e155d3630b40173666",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断地努力还有训练员的好点子，\r\n都是我支撑我跑下去的自信来源！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6456d7281d9a85b94353a749f91a855d9702f09156719970b63a5083ca795ff5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f21d803fc4551435996b950",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我说话和跑步都很不灵光…\r\n所以请让我用独一无二的胜利回赠给你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "728d2290a23a04ed1aab49cf7dd2449f0ba2f5f976b7d2e4748d39e1bb69e35a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30fbf16ff7c657bf79b4f787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好强的阳光啊！\r\n但是我是不会输的！\r\n太阳公公也请看好吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a03899f3d11a2f40a1d246fbf90f92975da91d94810cc467cd2669702a3a3424",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58158ebddbb63bf878cd13b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起奔向顶点的道路，我永远不会忘记！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34ca369210dbd8c2c665dcbbb9c7527bcd6869f7627593809ece99e64fe9037b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9876887fa3cd09c38ed40f87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "十分满意的成果！谢谢大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc3e07678f6f7afa9279ad314576ab1edb2a3554a18ceae7a69c0a385df91984",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d537ac5385ecffb15dc6ea07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要回应大家的期待…要变得更强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e57ba4565728bae5b7fea853a5b95c5695f6b44d3ed3133f5ea81880eea08a29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9ac50ec05ad0eeb6c72c246",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是，\r\n每天辛苦流汗的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27c328c3921041ba8515b1e8d3dc0832d8f5c7320499e14ac479da1eb9a11cea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1d7583ddec66b0955cb30ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是成田路！\r\n请多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "541496d252c4b13e8cda66cb67055f8eac6736025325c8ac919c959d38768793",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:188968e25497400251189be8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在是通往遥远顶点的道路\r\n如果和你一起的话，一定能行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfae2e008f9d996818e6a71074916c74b88d7197670020d5e742db6b41e76ebd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec037bb9a9dd44e45829a784",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像还能助我一臂之力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6225f5f25de952c2568d7937af4ad846dde7229b1ed3576343a2bb39065d0c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:256fbd8e952ae66271020e7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定会回应大家的期待的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "034365cb55a0d742c51606e8f2e6e980c50b2d8250305410e763477180c06024",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e930b5b6cedd59da076a16a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "带着风一起……",
      "source_fingerprint": "13f09c1a72a4f48385e1a7d7bb928e85bcbd5cca82e40b5b41270d150700de8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8054b12ab6d22046eb80402",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你是让我察觉何谓自由的春风──\r\n只要是和你一起，\r\n我这阵风就能吹到任何地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf77aeaa57f73bf01f53f036d8559bb3856d0074038722a7c346acf38cbd1dc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4ded82448838778373496f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ee1516a63193eff02c54e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46be5a6e0b6eab6778c8db3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风是无形且自由的存在……\r\n同样都喜欢风的我们，\r\n或许有些相似也说不定呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ac4713d58294d393583627c30a0270fd0c379f01a2dfc41d1dca688362aff3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eb2bfda3eba0ad54ed6bb56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也有必须携手才能吹起的风……\r\n我衷心期待……\r\n由你吹起的风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bc39c5e7866239814f0bb3df70b85b8ba1b76b477b9bfe2ab10243283cc8944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffcc268585e9d8b76c5f7909",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我向刚吹起的祥风发誓，\r\n并由衷地祈愿……\r\n希望它能守护我们的旅途……",
      "source_fingerprint": "76a84ccb36b39751e60fbaae12db76280098e06ecd86f01322f497952caab8c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7d504157ea17c41b491514d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把我、不倒翁和领带都喜欢的\r\n无花果加在巧克力里了。\r\n晚点再送给你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1157460d5d01df6d39ca45b6733eaa3f0e3bbba16cbf09d5ce75e7daa00b8b2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3af57033da916193b7e8b948",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呼……我听说，今天是\r\n传递心意的日子。所以把心意\r\n寄托在风中……你，有感受到吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e7d3bf8e7ceb2ce2542786f7215abcae0928d9ff4b62f7ace52e04648102a46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad28edc84a287d31889a9028",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又到了竹叶随着凉风摇摆，\r\n窸窸窣窣地……随着心愿，\r\n摇摆、哼唱的季节呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "849c0fc68d2ccfc431a67a45335e02a9b75157b84e7ec2fe3aa95ba29e87f178",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd61dce7acf46b131897b19e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉鬼怪与恶作剧妖精，\r\n都在风中起舞呢……呵呵，\r\n在万圣节，随着秋风而来的访客……",
      "source_fingerprint": "50ec6595b8a72197b4d0345f468f647ea3ef680277bb1bdea207025ae4d844c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:564072c311482a3b534a447e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一阵仙风造访了城镇……\r\n那位服装如火，胡须如云的\r\n可爱人士，是在工作吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca57a98b707bf58146c5205d519575cee3121c14e22ac77f8f53fca8c7becbfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8ed2d68ebc5238ad0de6fe6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都彷佛置身暖阳之中……\r\n如此圣夜，连寒气都和缓下来了呢。\r\n我们要不要也出去看看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "efaeca0b338ae9297c61e20bbf8804029ba582b383707c5e0bdb86c31e83c3a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c72d615d549dede21fc4597a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为风！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c803c8e3b1b2693e5c6c2969ec676de27951038c55759291e07cb4952fe3caab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5abd03424aa0216df5d4cc63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你觉得这一年的风如何呢？\r\n无论是龙卷风或徐风，\r\n希望都能成为明年的顺风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b424692b8ccd27097f15eab4712b6a90c10b1b2eaf0422801ebec428dc06f1e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:806741136bb67c350c3b27a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在暖风的吹拂之下，才有现在的我。\r\n我要为今天这个特别的日子\r\n献上祝福与感谢……祝你生日快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d84f3b5f628245cd21816f071b92d92aec5f5683b95b068b10f816c3ebb5537",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51ae0fd89d80b4f6cb5343ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，我有准备礼物。\r\n是我喜欢的森林里的泉水。\r\n……如果你喜欢，我再带你过去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4b559ce6e1cec9ff057c93995917f04e2df92ccb1eb3ac6d28d36c9fba88e91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01dec5b8e1c6a23837fa6eec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是微风诞生，以成为鲜明的风\r\n为目标开始吹拂的日子……\r\n直到成为风暴的那一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d223cb86ef503e41fa78622006a3630358b6eca9dcd41e0f2db2c11dce56b8c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85397ebaea9bc3e620297d14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要替我庆生？哎呀……呵呵，\r\n请等我一下，我想把今天，\r\n以及接下来要吹起的风牢记在心里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68daccad192c18279d1ad2c7a8b9bfb8ce5b7d025c4d1ae07a4ea468b46aa655",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a91bfa36bf546f04eb68a115",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告。\r\n确认一下风儿捎来的消息吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69c4c29e7848e10befe73557dd296b32492ad36de98920e372d88ecd089bfc17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41007e8a2011bc1602aab4fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物。\r\n呵呵，是谁送的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9efa6a31231c58b5381fe99bba18e50526fed08e3b2b3a51cf15231a7d61bad3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1168556ed915c29c7b9ebddc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成了。\r\n好像能够领取奖励喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1d30c04e2ca7d26be82d8fcc5ea2715d1868203c05961f4356dd083ed8fe171",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c760e49adc6bb9094b975cab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像快要办活动了。\r\n一起等待顺风吹起吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c39f043c3f39a2498806e53c735ed4827964fa8ea9d7ea00ad398e73527b60ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2e165a60bccb3f2fee4e447",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不晓得在活动中\r\n能遇到什么样的风？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ffc83a584f13475cc06063124b9d6229ef35f1ae6f1e9edc116b216c007f4b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:088201163cc7c3947ec4b656",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还要再吹得更强……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fae59adc75e5f0e6622b88b8bcb38f3d1306794a62b7fb04090c75acefcf0ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a2f2ef49f637ec53a6a9457",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册的等级好像提升了。\r\n不去查看一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "695381f5e89c2d76269bcc9b62cd290495d0fb281277f7980a4be6b634596d90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3204979426135ee35b9c046c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花朵胸针是母亲送的。\r\n它从出生起就陪伴在我身旁，\r\n与我共同分享着喜悦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1b63f29019b4d77693d1241d888aaa544939c5c45b3a536700fcf2c8618bc68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72dd7017e23195ca25ef6da4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这枚花朵胸针总能吸引朋友们驻足。\r\n身为瓢虫的星星先生是这里的常客呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d48bb629042382ec22d22baa44d6735ae27ae0959e4039e8a138f0a20b3010b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcc4fe989cbd05bea699abe7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不怎么看手机。\r\n那些通知……让人有点不舒畅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce9ed118d667d106c74e8839c36b8b90eae23c044edbf0c543c697d5d9637ed9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b89c303fab3f8bd873714f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平手了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fd970f84d5214f61a9caa920a294685057c39c38a518d0b88dce068bfef17d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4906ca70d0469c7b601ba73d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祥风吹拂，获得胜利了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2e19f25d9ca3cfa54c132743af02c6833eebe92731dd85d25f21477cbf1f597",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c408a3c0c4ae0ce0c41c5e33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还要再吹得更强……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fae59adc75e5f0e6622b88b8bcb38f3d1306794a62b7fb04090c75acefcf0ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89e7b7fb073619537836acb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平手了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fd970f84d5214f61a9caa920a294685057c39c38a518d0b88dce068bfef17d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a3c37a2aef784d6c79d1485",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更新了高分纪录。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dbf72e6ca6be76291e776aeaf979177cb07623fa8acd888f83a6a4645ec87da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:058a706003bddd76012f8ee7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，一起掀起一阵风吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6d9b358f4b8d271e8a521936544367f1fcf213ffe6bc845020a1b3aa509faf9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aae609ec4f066455dbac85d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b79b4d7520322abdbdf19d29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要训练了吗？\r\n今天会吹起什么样的风呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51ed07ce9010fd4b072a9202f069f8eb3f5da8798707b6c6e13a7b0ed4bcee86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7781aa9215a7a77ccc74095",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你还记得那道在回忆中\r\n吹拂的风吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dc76051e20b04370e0206eb32d9a3a635578164dd6c1fcedbf8ed6633672cb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07bdc66e3a1c42c82295f5db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要参赛啊。\r\n一起去见跑得飞快的台风吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae2b2186e22ec6c7978b1c2da4aa1996814e215106797e95b28455a7acf2333b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "110002"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
